        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text: In the Shopify admin main sidebar you'll see a menu **Solvo – Support Tickets & Helpdesk** with links: [Support](/support), [Support](/support), [FAQ](/faq), [Documentation](/docs), [Billing](/billing), and [Privacy](/privacy). Click any link to go to that section.
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "div",
}'''
      }
    }
    {
      id: "8"
      L: Attr
      P: {
        css:
          '''return `._id {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: ${args.theme.var.color.text_light_500};
  margin: 0;
}`;'''
        displayOrder: 3
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''[Support](/support) is where you see and manage your ticket list. [Support](/support) is where you send a message to our team or see replies. [FAQ](/faq), [Documentation](/docs), and [Tutorial](/tutorial) are help pages you can read anytime. [Billing](/billing) and [Privacy](/privacy) are for your subscription and our privacy policy. You can bookmark or share a page if you want to come back to it later.
'''
        props:
          '''return {
  as: "div",
}'''
      }
    }
