        displayOrder: 2
        textType: markdown
        componentName: Html
        text:
          '''**When you create a new root category, the new menu is also created** for that category in the Shopify. When you change or remove a category or a child category, the app updates or removes that part of the menu in Shopify. Any time you create, edit, delete, or move a category, the app keeps the menu in sync. All of this happens in the background so the app stays quick and easy to use.

'''
